#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:102
msgid "Player:"
msgstr "Odtwarzacz:"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:105
msgctxt "player field placeholder"
msgid "whoever is playing"
msgstr "ten, który gra"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:109
msgid ""
"Empty: whoever is playing. Otherwise a part of the player's name\n"
"or desktop entry — vlc, spotify, strawberry; when no player matches,\n"
"back to whoever is playing."
msgstr ""
"Puste: ten, który gra. Inaczej fragment nazwy odtwarzacza\n"
"lub jego pliku desktop — vlc, spotify, strawberry; gdy żaden nie pasuje,\n"
"znów ten, który gra."

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:116
msgid "Album:"
msgstr "Album:"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:118
msgid "show the album line"
msgstr "pokazuj wiersz albumu"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:123
msgid "Controls:"
msgstr "Sterowanie:"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:125
msgid "show the previous, play/pause and next row"
msgstr "pokazuj wiersz przycisków: wstecz, odtwarzaj/pauza, dalej"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:129
msgid ""
"With no player on the bus the centre of the ring stays empty.\n"
"The controls take the mouse even while the rest passes clicks through."
msgstr ""
"Bez odtwarzacza na szynie środek pierścienia pozostaje pusty.\n"
"Przyciski przyjmują mysz, nawet gdy reszta przepuszcza kliknięcia."

